mentions.source_excerpt:
A port of linq-to-sql for Typescript (https://github.com/webpods-org/tinqer)
allowing queries like:

  const activeAdults = from<User>("users")
    .where((u) => u.age >= 18)
    .where((u) => u.active === true);

It mostly works.

